🫦 Togetherly • v1.27.0

— Android notifications arrive with the app closed, and the "Togetherly is connected" line is gone from the shade.
— Event times finally match for couples in different time zones: "just now" means just now.
— Custom moods in Togetherly+: an emoji, a photo or a drawing, plus your own caption.
— The Notifications section in settings no longer opens empty.
— The main timer stays the main one after a restart.
— A video in watch-together is removed by a tap instead of opening the room with an ad.
— The drawing canvas no longer stutters when you move or rotate it.
